          "type": "text",
          "html": "<blockquote><p class=\"align-right\">Nothing can be forced to live.<br/>The earth is like a drug now, like a voice from far away,<br/>a lover or master. In the end, you do what the voice tells you.<br/>It says forget, you forget.<br/>It says begin again, you begin again.</p><p class=\"align-right\"><strong>Louise Glück</strong></p></blockquote>"
